  ## Order Application Service

  [Component: Python]

  Coordinates validation, payment, and order creation.

  | Property | Value |
  | --- | --- |
  | Owner | Checkout Team |
  | Runtime | Python |
|| {
  shape: rectangle
}
inventory_checker: ||md
  ## Inventory Checker

  [Component: Python]

  Verifies stock availability before an order is confirmed.

  | Property | Value |
  | --- | --- |
  | Owner | Checkout Team |
  | Runtime | Python |
|| {
  shape: rectangle
}
