order_db: ||md
  ## Order Database

  [Component: PostgreSQL]

  Stores orders, line items, and order status history.

  | Property | Value |
  | --- | --- |
  | Owner | Checkout Team |
  | Runtime | PostgreSQL |
|| {
  shape: cylinder
  class: ["c4_database"]
}
payment_gateway_api: ||md
  ## Payment Gateway API

  [Component: REST API]

  External provider API for payment authorization and capture.

  | Property | Value |
